-357pua" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1fdof4g" data-styles-preset="FI_T7Sxjs" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left;--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0)))">Wedding inspiration</p></div></div></div><div class="framer-1wr59sp" data-framer-name="Date" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1n2u63g" data-styles-preset="toQx25qsz" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center"><time datetime="2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z">Jun 10, 2026</time></p></div></div><div class="framer-ofim04" data-framer-appear-id="ofim04" data-framer-name="Title" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="opacity:0.001;transform:translateY(30px)"><h1 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xj1ajo" data-styles-preset="xJxHrTFcn" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">Questions Before Hiring A Planner</h1></div><div class="framer-1o5rc1f" data-framer-appear-id="1o5rc1f" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="opacity:0.001;transform:translateY(30px)"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">Hiring the right wedding planner starts with asking the right questions. Learn what every couple should discuss before choosing a planner for their big day.</p></div></div><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-ni6daz" style="will-change:transform;height:auto;aspect-ratio:2.08955223880597;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="1400" height="670" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) calc(min(max(100vw - 40px, 1px), 760px) - 60px), (max-width: 809.98px) calc(min(max(100vw - 40px, 1px), 760px) - 40px), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) calc(min(max(100vw - 40px, 1px), 760px) - 40px)" srcset="https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=1400&amp;height=670 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=1400&amp;height=670 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?width=1400&amp;height=670 1400w" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?width=1400&amp;height=670" alt="Image" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-1rgk7lu"><div class="framer-1qe0bbu" data-framer-name="Content" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Choosing a wedding planner is one of the most important decisions you will make during the planning process. The right planner can reduce stress, manage logistics, and bring your vision to life with confidence.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Before signing a contract, make sure you ask thoughtful questions that help you understand their experience, process, and compatibility with your needs.</p><h2 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-z05tco">Ask about their experience</h2><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Experience matters when planning an event with so many moving parts.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Questions to consider:</p><div class="framer-text framer-text-module" style="width:100%;height:auto" data-width="fill"><div class="ssr-variant hidden-nxygfm"><div class="framer-G8Q0s framer-GDgi6 framer-1u6t3dr framer-v-1u6t3dr" data-framer-name="Desktop"><div class="framer-1pwrf6u" data-framer-name="Left"><div class="framer-1e5ew0h" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1kjsh90" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-ohefiq" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">How many weddings have you planned?</p></div></div><div class="framer-jzevuy" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-18uhuuv" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-zp2x2b" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">What types of weddings do you specialize in?</p></div></div><div class="framer-1yfyin6" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1ug66l6" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-1tm5esw" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Have you worked at our venue before?</p></div></div><div class="framer-1z0ui9o" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-663epk" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-1f2ep2" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Do you handle destination weddings?</p></div></div><div class="framer-mv48em" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1xp5ofn" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-149rzmb" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Full vendor sourcing &amp; management</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-1wcfnls"><div class="framer-G8Q0s framer-GDgi6 framer-1u6t3dr framer-v-1e6x0gt" data-framer-name="Phone"><div class="framer-1pwrf6u" data-framer-name="Left"><div class="framer-1e5ew0h" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1kjsh90" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-ra