div></div><div class="framer-jzevuy" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-18uhuuv" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-zp2x2b" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Partial planning</p></div></div><div class="framer-1yfyin6" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1ug66l6" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-1tm5esw" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Month-of coordination</p></div></div><div class="framer-1z0ui9o" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-663epk" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-1f2ep2" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Day-of coordination only</p></div></div><div class="framer-mv48em" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1xp5ofn" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-149rzmb" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Full vendor sourcing &amp; management</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Choose the service level that fits your needs and budget.</p><h2 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-z05tco">Final thoughts</h2><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Hiring a wedding planner is about more than credentials it is about finding someone who understands your vision, communicates clearly, and makes you feel supported throughout the process.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">The right planner will not only manage your wedding but also enhance your entire planning experience.</p></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-nxygfm hidden-1wcfnls"><div class="framer-1qe0bbu" data-framer-name="Content" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Choosing a wedding planner is one of the most important decisions you will make during the planning process. The right planner can reduce stress, manage logistics, and bring your vision to life with confidence.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Before signing a contract, make sure you ask thoughtful questions that help you understand their experience, process, and compatibility with your needs.</p><h2 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-z05tco">Ask about their experience</h2><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Experience matters when planning an event with so many moving parts.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Questions to consider:</p><div class="framer-text framer-text-module" style="width:100%;height:auto" data-width="fill"><div class="framer-G8Q0s framer-GDgi6 framer-1u6t3dr framer-v-13cpfwp" data-framer-name="Tablet"><div class="framer-1pwrf6u" data-framer-name="Left"><div class="framer-1e5ew0h" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1kjsh90" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-ohefiq" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">How many weddings have you planned?</p></div></div><div class="framer-jzevuy" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-18uhuuv" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-zp2x2b" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">What types of weddings do you specialize in?</p></div></div><div class="framer-1yfyin6" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1ug66l6" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-1tm5esw" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Have you worked at our venue before?</p></div></div><div class="framer-1z0ui9o" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-663epk" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-1f2ep2" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Do you handle destination weddings?</p></div></div><div class="framer-mv48em" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1xp5ofn" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-149rzmb" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Full vendor sourcing &amp; management</p></div></div></div></div></div><h2 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-z05tco">Understand their planning services</h2><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Not all planners offer the same level of support.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-n3qk32">Clarify whether they provide:</p><div class="framer-text framer-text-module" style="width:100%;height:auto" data-width="fill"><div class="framer-G8Q0s framer-GDgi6 framer-1u6t3dr framer-v-13cpfwp" data-framer-name="Tablet"><div class="framer-1pwrf6u" data-framer-name="Left"><div class="framer-1e5ew0h" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1kjsh90" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-ohefiq" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Full-service planning</p></div></div><div class="framer-jzevuy" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-18uhuuv" data-framer-name="Dot" style="background-color:var(--token-bccfcd92-a499-41fc-83d4-e7ebe63c0b21, rgb(0, 0, 0));border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px"></div><div class="framer-zp2x2b" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Partial planning</p></div></div><div class="framer-1yfyin6" data-framer-name="List"><div class="framer-1ug66l6" data-frame