teralValue\",\"value\":\"questions-before-hiring-a-planner\"}}}default",[4],{"b5wBeAtfm":5,"Qv4C1pAHY":8,"VGN0IV2sB":10,"tWLDC7KSK":12,"TZaGj0C5T":15,"gtd9uApZl":23,"id":28},{"type":6,"value":7},"string","Questions Before Hiring A Planner",{"type":6,"value":9},"Wedding inspiration",{"type":6,"value":11},"Hiring the right wedding planner starts with asking the right questions. Learn what every couple should discuss before choosing a planner for their big day.",{"type":13,"value":14},"date","2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z",{"type":16,"value":17},"responsiveimage",{"src":18,"srcSet":19,"pixelWidth":20,"pixelHeight":21,"alt":22},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?width=1400&height=670","https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1400&height=670 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1400&height=670 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1WR7tW4jtHBlpKiRiR5K7NtpY.jpg?width=1400&height=670 1400w",1400,670,"Image",{"type":24,"value":25},"richtext",{"collectionId":26,"pointer":27},"9c4f93e4-9787-436f-ac9f-0410b5ae81d2default","[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Choosing a wedding planner is one of the most important decisions you will make during the planning process. The right planner can reduce stress, manage logistics, and bring your vision to life with confidence.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Before signing a contract, make sure you ask thoughtful questions that help you understand their experience, process, and compatibility with your needs.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Ask about their experience\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Experience matters when planning an event with so many moving parts.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Questions to consider:\"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"local-module:canvasComponent/Xq5rQ7YB5:default\",{\"variant\":null,\"GLnkIfV6Q\":\"How many weddings have you planned?\",\"CEFvc6F4f\":\"What types of weddings do you specialize in?\",\"XQwFy4oed\":\"Have you worked at our venue before?\",\"fynp7MMZO\":\"Do you handle destination weddings?\",\"Wx8m_c4Sb\":\"Full vendor sourcing & management\"},[],[]]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Understand their planning services\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Not all planners offer the same level of support.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Clarify whether they provide:\"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"local-module:canvasComponent/Xq5rQ7YB5:default\",{\"variant\":null,\"GLnkIfV6Q\":\"Full-service planning\",\"CEFvc6F4f\":\"Partial planning\",\"XQwFy4oed\":\"Month-of coordination\",\"fynp7MMZO\":\"Day-of coordination only\",\"Wx8m_c4Sb\":\"Full vendor sourcing & management\"},[],[]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Choose the service level that fits your needs and budget.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Final thoughts\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Hiring a wedding planner is about more than credentials it is about finding someone who understands your vision, communicates clearly, and makes you feel supported throughout the process.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The right planner will not only manage your wedding but also enhance your entire planning experience.\"]]]",{"type":6,"value":29},"mi1vuEUBe","{\"from\":\"9c4f93e4-9787-436f-ac9f-0410b5ae81d2\",\"limit\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":4},\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"SFYJSdAiK\",\"name\":\"NCOZYk8nL\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"SFYJSdAiK\",\"name\":\"Qv4C1pAHY\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"SFYJSdAiK\",\"name\":\"tWLDC7KSK\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"SFYJSdAiK\",\"name\":\"b5wBeAtfm\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"SFYJSdAiK\",\"name\":\"i_bCx33Jy\",\"